## Get all vehicles
GET http://localhost:5000/vehicles

###

## Create a new vehicle
POST http://localhost:5000/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "BMW",
    "model": "X5",
    "year": 2025,
    "vin": "5UXCR6C0XJLL12345"
}

